					"content": "嗚呶…好想搔肚皮…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721080802
					],
					"speakerTitle": "五百藏"
				},
				{
					"id": 721080802,
					"content": "#呶？呶？{F#妳}{M#你}這小輩怎麼又回來了。幫吾輩找到「證城」、「刑部小判」和「吉法師」這<color=#00E1FFFF>三隻小狸子</color>，陪他們玩玩吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721080803
					],
					"speakerTitle": "五百藏"
				},
				{
					"id": 721080803,
					"content": "好了好了，快去吧！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
